  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25146634",
      "title": "Adding Links & Navigation",
      "lectureOrder": 67,
      "videoOrder": 62,
      "sourceHash": "c1b545c281d80a55c9bfd1737563913d9e3be40d0e0fcfe99dad4097eb45442c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 3.23,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] Now let's take care",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.23,
          "end": 8.22,
          "en": "about adding such a navigation bar to our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.22,
          "end": 10.74,
          "en": "And for this I'll go to the components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.74,
          "end": 12.64,
          "en": "and add a new folder in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.64,
          "end": 15.01,
          "en": "And I'll name it layout, because it will hold",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.01,
          "end": 17.75,
          "en": "some general layout components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.75,
          "end": 20.57,
          "en": "So a sub-folder inside of components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.57,
          "end": 24.85,
          "en": "and in there I'll add the main navigation.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.85,
          "end": 26.56,
          "en": "which is the file that should hold",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.56,
          "end": 29.41,
          "en": "this main navigation component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.41,
          "end": 32.33,
          "en": "Now I added it here in the components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.33,
          "end": 34.39,
          "en": "and not in the pages folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.39,
          "end": 36.87,
          "en": "because this component will not be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.87,
          "end": 39.5,
          "en": "as a page with help of the router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.5,
          "end": 41.59,
          "en": "but instead we will embed it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.59,
          "end": 46.15,
          "en": "in the content of our other code just as we did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.15,
          "end": 49.32,
          "en": "Totally unrelated to the router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.32,
          "end": 51.89,
          "en": "Now in this main navigation component file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.89,
          "end": 55.7,
          "en": "we can again define our component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.7,
          "end": 60.7,
          "en": "MainNavigation, and export it as we're used to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.9,
          "end": 64.09,
          "en": "And then of course return some JSX content here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.09,
          "end": 66.56,
          "en": "And here I wanna return a header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.56,
          "end": 70.69,
          "en": "a header component which in the end will then wrap",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.69,
          "end": 75.03,
          "en": "all the items that should go into this header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.03,
          "end": 79.23,
          "en": "And here I actually wanna have a div first with my logo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.23,
          "end": 81.23,
          "en": "which in this case will just be some text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.23,
          "end": 84.4,
          "en": "I'll name it React Meetups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.4,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "And then next to this div, inside of the header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.45,
          "end": 90.97,
          "en": "I'll add a nav element, and here I'll then add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.97,
          "end": 93.74000000000001,
          "en": "an unordered list with a couple of list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.74000000000001,
          "end": 97.95,
          "en": "where all those list items will be the different links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.95,
          "end": 99.71000000000001,
          "en": "which we have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.71000000000001,
          "end": 101.75,
          "en": "Now, when it comes to those links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.75,
          "end": 105.09,
          "en": "we typically render links by using the anchor tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.09,
          "end": 107.93299999999999,
          "en": "That's how we do that in standard HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.87,
          "end": 113.02000000000001,
          "en": "We could do this here as well but using that link component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.02000000000001,
          "end": 117,
          "en": "that link element, has one big disadvantage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117,
          "end": 119.93,
          "en": "If we use a link like this, whenever we click it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.93,
          "end": 123.74,
          "en": "a new request will be sent to the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.74,
          "end": 126.28,
          "en": "The server here is the server hosting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.28,
          "end": 129.37,
          "en": "this React application, and indeed that server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.37,
          "end": 132.33,
          "en": "would then reply with our application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.33,
          "end": 136.01,
          "en": "and there the router would figure out which page to load.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.01,
          "end": 140.73,
          "en": "So a link would work but, we send this request first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 142.25,
          "en": "which is redundant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.25,
          "end": 146.29,
          "en": "We already are in our running React application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.29,
          "end": 148.93,
          "en": "and it would be great if we don't leave it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.93,
          "end": 151.79,
          "en": "just because we wanna navigate somewhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.79,
          "end": 153.7,
          "en": "Hence sending that extra request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.7,
          "end": 156.85,
          "en": "is not something we necessarily wanna do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.85,
          "end": 159.24,
          "en": "That's why instead of this anchor tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.24,
          "end": 162.53,
          "en": "we instead use another component provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.53,
          "end": 165.38,
          "en": "by the react-router-dom package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.38,
          "end": 169.14,
          "en": "So we again import from react-router-dom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.14,
          "end": 173.76,
          "en": "and we import the Link component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.76,
          "end": 177.82,
          "en": "The Link component can be wrapped around our link text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.82,
          "end": 181.06,
          "en": "just like the anchor tag, and it will render",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.06,
          "end": 185,
          "en": "a anchor tag in the end but, internally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185,
          "end": 187.8,
          "en": "react-router-dom attaches a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 187.8,
          "end": 190.25,
          "en": "to the anchor tag, and when you click on it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.25,
          "end": 194.5,
          "en": "it will prevent that browser default of sending a request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.5,
          "end": 199.4,
          "en": "and instead just parse the URL you want to go to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.4,
          "end": 202.01,
          "en": "change it in the browser URL bar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.01,
          "end": 204.09,
          "en": "but then not send the request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.09,
          "end": 208.27,
          "en": "but instead load the appropriate component onto the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.27,
          "end": 210.93,
          "en": "just with React and JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.93,
          "end": 213.78,
          "en": "so that we stay on this already loaded page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.78,
          "end": 217.04,
          "en": "and we don't send this extra request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 217.04,
          "end": 219.253,
          "en": "So that's why we add links like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.15,
          "end": 222.57999999999998,
          "en": "Now, of course, here that should not be some link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.57999999999998,
          "end": 225.59,
          "en": "but a link to all the meetups let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 225.59,
          "end": 230.59,
          "en": "And to make Link aware of the URL it should navigate to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 230.87,
          "end": 233.69,
          "en": "we have to set the to prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 233.69,
          "end": 237.95,
          "en": "This is one of the expected props on the link component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.95,
          "end": 242.25,
          "en": "And here we set a path in this case just slash nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 242.25,
          "end": 246.377,
          "en": "because that is the path to the AllMeetupsPage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 248.75,
          "end": 253.75,
          "en": "Now we can replicate this, and add two more list items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 254.32,
          "end": 258.16,
          "en": "where the second one leads to /new-meetup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 258.16,
          "end": 262.55,
          "en": "and says new meetup or Add New Meetup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 262.55,
          "end": 264.26,
          "en": "that's up to you, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 264.26,
          "end": 267.13,
          "en": "And on the last link we go to /favorites",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 267.13,
          "end": 272.13,
          "en": "and we say favorites, or My Favorites, something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 274.49,
          "end": 276.53,
          "en": "Now we got those links in place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 276.53,
          "end": 279.15999999999997,
          "en": "and we got this main navigation component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 279.15999999999997,
          "end": 282.13,
          "en": "We can now use this in the App.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 282.13,
          "end": 285.45,
          "en": "and there we can now import main navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 285.45,
          "end": 290.45,
          "en": "from ./components/layout/MainNavigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 291.11,
          "end": 294.51,
          "en": "and add this above that Switch statement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 294.51,
          "end": 299.23,
          "en": "Here we can add MainNavigation as a self-closing tag still,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 299.23,
          "end": 300.303,
          "en": "if we want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 301.61,
          "end": 304.43,
          "en": "If we save this, we'll see some navigation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 304.43,
          "end": 306.67,
          "en": "And if you click those links, they work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 306.67,
          "end": 310.42,
          "en": "The styling is missing, but we got working links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 310.42,
          "end": 312.61,
          "en": "We got a working navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 312.61,
          "end": 314.13,
          "en": "Now I want to add some styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 314.13,
          "end": 316.99,
          "en": "and for this, we're going to explore a different way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 316.99,
          "end": 318.993,
          "en": "of styling our components.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
